      "id": "edm-1791960652101-6a0a71ac",
      "type": "overview",
      "subject": "Movie Club Recap: But, how do they shit?",
      "sentAt": "2026-10-14T06:50:52.101Z",
      "recipients": [],
      "status": "failed",
      "error": "No recipient emails configured in Admin EDM Settings",
      "previewText": "Ash Macintosh has published the official session chronicle: But, how do they shit?",
      "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\" class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Language\" content=\"en\">\n  <meta name=\"google\" content=\"notranslate\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>But, how do they shit?</title>\n</head>\n<body class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f3f4f6; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #18181b; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">\n  <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 32px 16px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <!-- Main Container: Light White Editorial Card -->\n        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 620px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n          \n          <!-- Golden Velvet Header Ribbon -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"height: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d97706, #fbbf24, #d97706);\"></td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Branding & Category Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 28px 32px 18px; background-color: #fafaf9; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e5e4;\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td>\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #b45309; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n                      ★ MOVIE CLUB ARCHIVES • OFFICIAL SESSION CHRONICLE\n                    </span>\n                    <h1 style=\"margin: 10px 0 6px; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; color: #09090b; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">\n                      But, how do they shit?\n                    </h1>\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #52525b;\">\n                      Curated & Written by <strong style=\"color: #b45309;\">Ash Macintosh</strong> • Session of Fri, 9 Oct 2026\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Hero Gathering Photo -->\n          \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f5; text-align: center;\">\n              <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517604931442-7e0c8ed2963c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"But, how do they shit?\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 440px; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e5e4;\" />\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n\n          <!-- Film Badge & Quick Facts -->\n          \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 22px 32px; background-color: #fdfbf7; border-bottom: 1px solid #f2ede4;\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  \n                  <td width=\"80\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 18px;\">\n                    <img src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wobVTa99eW0ht6c1rNNzLkazPtR.jpg\" alt=\"The Long Walk\" width=\"80\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; display: block; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\" />\n                  </td>\n                  \n                  <td valign=\"middle\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 10px; color: #b45309; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em;\">FEATURED FILM</span>\n                    <h2 style=\"margin: 4px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #09090b;\">The Long Walk <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #71717a; font-weight: normal;\">(2025)</span></h2>\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #52525b; line-height: 1.4;\">\n                      Directed by <strong style=\"color: #18181b;\">Francis Lawrence</strong> • Host: <strong style=\"color: #b45309;\">Max Smith</strong>\n                       • 108 min\n                       • Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror\n                    </p>\n                    \n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n\n          <!-- Ash's Night Overview Narrative Body (Light White Background with Dark, Ultra-Legible Text) -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 32px 32px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 12px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #71717a;\">\n                THE NIGHT'S CHRONICLE\n              </h3>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: #18181b; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-wrap;\">It’s tough to keep an audience engaged when a film is set in one location. Although this film does technically travel through fictional America, the road they walk is essentially one setting they never leave. To make it even harder for the director, we as the audience immediately know that all but one of the cast members will likely die. To overcome these there is a HEAVY reliance on the actors and the writing but its masterfully done in all aspects. The way they managed to get me to care so deeply about even the most despicable characters right before their demise by breaking them down, finally showing their true vulnerability was heartbreaking and so human. I will also say the plot twist at the end was a really left field hook I didn’t see coming so kudos to Stephen King on that one. 4.5/5 with the only draw back being the final scene felt like it had less weight than some of the previous deaths.</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Ash's Top Review Highlight (if present) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Call to action button -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 8px 32px 36px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n              <a href=\"https://movieclub.local\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d97706; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.35);\">\n                Enter Movie Club Platform →\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 22px 32px; background-color: #fafaf9; border-top: 1px solid #e7e5e4; text-align: center;\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #78716c; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\">\n                Movie Club Fortnightly NZT 19:00 • Sent in English to official club EDM distribution list\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
