New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 10px; color: #b45309; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em;\">FEATURED FILM</span>\n                    <h2 style=\"margin: 4px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #09090b;\">The King of Kong: A Fistful of Quarters <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #71717a; font-weight: normal;\">(2007)</span></h2>\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #52525b; line-height: 1.4;\">\n                      Directed by <strong style=\"color: #18181b;\">Seth Gordon</strong> • Host: <strong style=\"color: #b45309;\">James Macintosh</strong>\n                       • 83 min\n                       • Documentary\n                    </p>\n                    \n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n\n          <!-- Ash's Night Overview Narrative Body (Light White Background with Dark, Ultra-Legible Text) -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 32px 32px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 12px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #71717a;\">\n                THE NIGHT'S CHRONICLE\n              </h3>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: #18181b; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-wrap;\">You couldn't script better characters than Steve Wiebe and Billy Mitchell if you tried. The quintessential David versus Goliath documentary that had the entire room cheering for every single hammer smash and barrel jump. An absolute crowd pleaser that exceeded all expectations.</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Ash's Top Review Highlight (if present) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Call to action button -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 8px