09; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em;\">FEATURED FILM</span>\n                    <h2 style=\"margin: 4px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #09090b;\">Heavenly Creatures <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #71717a; font-weight: normal;\">(1994)</span></h2>\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #52525b; line-height: 1.4;\">\n                      Directed by <strong style=\"color: #18181b;\">Peter Jackson</strong> • Host: <strong style=\"color: #b45309;\">Madison Hill</strong>\n                       • 109 min\n                       • Drama, Fantasy\n                    </p>\n                    \n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n\n          <!-- Ash's Night Overview Narrative Body (Light White Background with Dark, Ultra-Legible Text) -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 32px 32px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 12px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #71717a;\">\n                THE NIGHT'S CHRONICLE\n              </h3>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: #18181b; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A haunting local treasure that hit close to home. The fantasy dream sequences and the incredible breakout performances from Kate Winslet and Melanie Lynskey made this one of our most stylistically unique evenings. Tragic, vivid, and deeply atmospheric New Zealand cinema.</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Ash's Top Review Highlight (if present) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Call to action button -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 8px 32px 36px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n              <a href=\"https://movie