rime\n                    </p>\n\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #a1a1aa;\">\n                      After his six-year-old daughter is abducted, a desperate father takes justice into his own hands when he loses faith in the detective leading the investigation, setting both men on a collision course as the search descen...\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Schedule Callout Box -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1c1511; border: 1px solid #38271a; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\">\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #a1a1aa; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">\n                      Mark Your Calendar\n                    </span>\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #fbbf24; margin-top: 4px;\">\n                      Sat, 1 Aug 2026 • 7:00 PM NZT\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Enter Site Button -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 32px 32px;\">\n              <a href=\"https://movieclub.local\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #f59e0b; color: #09090b; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);\">\n                View Details & Trailer on Site →\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n    